MIP), established at Madras Christian College with the generous support of the MRF Foundation, is a pioneering innovation ecosystem dedicated to research, innovation, entrepreneurship, and startup development. Spread across 45,000 sq. ft., MMIP is the largest innovation park among liberal arts and science colleges in India, and one of the first-of-its-kind innovation parks established within a liberal arts and science institution.','textarea','about_organizer','MMIP Paragraph 1','2026-09-07 04:18:04','2026-09-07 04:18:04'),(145,'mmip_p2','MMIP integrates research, design thinking, technology, and entrepreneurship into a multidisciplinary academic environment, demonstrating that innovation can flourish across disciplines beyond engineering. It serves as a scalable model for higher education institutions seeking to promote innovation-driven education, interdisciplinary collaboration, and entrepreneurial thinking.','textarea','about_organizer','MMIP Paragraph 2','2026-09-07 04:18:04','2026-09-07 04:18:04'),(146,'micro_tab_title','Dept. of Microbiology','text','about_organizer','Microbiology Tab Nav Title','2026-09-07 04:18:04','2026-09-07 04:18:04'),(147,'micro_tab_sub','Est. 2002 • Research Unit','text','about_organizer','Microbiology Tab Nav Subtitle','2026-09-07 04:18:04','2026-09-07 04:18:04'),(148,'micro_tag','Madras Christian College','text','about_organizer','Microbiology Tagline','2026-09-07 04:18:04','2026-09-07 04:18:04'),(149,'micro_title','Department of Microbiology','text','about_organizer','Microbiology Title','2026-09-07 04:18:04','2026-09-07 04:18:04'),(150,'chem_tab_title','Dept. of Chemistry (SFS)','text','about_organizer','Chemistry Tab Nav Title','2026-09-07 04:18:04','2026-09-07 04:18:04'),(151,'chem_tab_sub','Est. 2003 • M.Sc. Program','text','about_organizer','Chemistry Tab Nav Subtitle','2026-09-07 04:18:04','2026-09-07 04:18:04'),(152,'chem_tag','Madras Christian College','text','about_organizer','Chemistry Tagline','2026-09-07 04:18:04','2026-