isually appealing.','text','guidelines',NULL,'2026-09-07 06:06:32','2026-09-07 06:06:32'),(226,'poster_item_3','Required Elements: Title, Authors, Affiliation, Introduction, Methods, Results, Conclusion.','text','guidelines',NULL,'2026-09-07 06:06:32','2026-09-07 06:06:32'),(227,'poster_item_4','Attendance: Presenters must be present during the poster session.','text','guidelines',NULL,'2026-09-07 06:06:32','2026-09-07 06:06:32'),(228,'poster_dim_label','POSTER DIMENSIONS','text','guidelines',NULL,'2026-09-07 06:06:32','2026-09-07 06:06:32'),(229,'poster_dim_val','90 cm (Width) × 120 cm (Height)','text','guidelines',NULL,'2026-09-07 06:06:32','2026-09-07 06:06:32'),(230,'pub_desc','Selected peer-reviewed manuscripts will be considered for publication in our partnering international journals and indexed proceedings, offering global visibility for your research.','text','guidelines',NULL,'2026-09-07 06:06:32','2026-09-07 06:06:32'),(231,'pub_1_title','Scopus-Indexed Journals','text','guidelines',NULL,'2026-09-07 06:06:32','2026-09-07 06:06:32'),(232,'pub_1_desc','Manuscripts meeting high academic standards will be recommended for fast-track publication in recognized Scopus-indexed journals.','text','guidelines',NULL,'2026-09-07 06:06:32','2026-09-07 06:06:32'),(233,'pub_2_title','ISBN Proceedings','text','guidelines',NULL,'2026-09-07 06:06:32','2026-09-07 06:06:32'),(234,'pub_2_desc','Accepted abstracts and short papers will be compiled and published in official edited conference proceedings with a registered ISBN.','text','guidelines',NULL,'2026-09-07 06:06:32','2026-09-07 06:06:32'),(235,'pub_3_title','Special Issues','text','guidelines',NULL,'2026-09-07 06:06:32','2026-09-07 06:06:32'),(236,'pub_3_desc','Exceptional papers may be selected for special thematic issues with partnering international journals, subject to standard peer-review.','text','guidelines',NULL,'2026-09-07 06:06:32','2026-09-07 06:06:32'),(250,'reg_section_title','Registration Plans','text','regi