26-10-07 03:37:18'),(518,'oral_section_title','Abstract Submission & Oral Presentation Guidelines','text','oral_presentation',NULL,'2026-10-07 03:37:18','2026-10-07 03:37:18'),(519,'oral_announcement','We are delighted to announce abstract submissions from scientists, academicians, healthcare professionals, research scholars, and students working across the One Health domains. Selected abstracts will be allotted slots for live oral presentations during dedicated technical track sessions.','text','oral_presentation',NULL,'2026-10-07 03:37:18','2026-10-07 03:37:18'),(520,'oral_spec_duration','8 mins presentation + 2 mins Q&A','text','oral_presentation',NULL,'2026-10-07 03:37:18','2026-10-07 03:37:18'),(521,'oral_spec_format','16:9 Widescreen (PPTX / PDF)','text','oral_presentation',NULL,'2026-10-07 03:37:18','2026-10-07 03:37:18'),(522,'oral_spec_lang','English (Official Conference Medium)','text','oral_presentation',NULL,'2026-10-07 03:37:18','2026-10-07 03:37:18'),(523,'oral_guidelines_json','[\"Applicable Tracks: Dedicated guidelines for Track 1 (Medical Practitioners) and Track 6 (Industry)\",\"Submit the abstract in MS-Word format. The abstract should be 250\\u2013300 words in length.\",\"Abstracts will be considered only after receipt of registration fee.\",\"Presenting author is to be marked with # and corresponding author with *\",\"Include 5 to 6 keywords at the end of the abstract.\",\"Upload the Abstract using the designated Google Form submission portal.\",\"Provide the email ID of the corresponding author.\"]','text','oral_presentation',NULL,'2026-10-07 03:37:18','2026-10-07 03:40:05'),(524,'pre_conf_hero_title','PRE-CONFERENCE WORKSHOP','text','pre_conference',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:04:46','2026-10-07 04:04:46'),(525,'pre_conf_hero_sub1','Pre-Conference Consultative Workshop on 9th October 2026','text','pre_conference',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:04:46','2026-10-07 04:04:46'),(526,'pre_conf_hero_sub2','GLOBAL ONE HEALTH CONFLUENCE 2026','text','pre_conference',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:04:46','2026-10-07 04:04:46'),(527,'pre_conf_hero_sub3','Bridging Microbes, Molecules & Mankind for Sustainability','text','pre_conference',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:04:46','2026-10-07 04:04:46'),(528,'pre_conf_preamble_title','PREAMBLE','text','pre_conference',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:04:46','2026-10-07 04:04:46'),(529,'pre_conf_preamble_icon','fa-solid fa-book-open','text','pre_conference',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:04:46','2026-10-07 04:04:46'),(532,'pre_conf_obj_1','To obtain expert inputs for the scientific and thematic planning of Global One Health Confluence 2026.','text','pre_conference',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:04:46','2026-10-07 04:04:46'),(533,'pre_conf_obj_2','To facilitate interdisciplinary dialogue on human health, animal health, environmental health and allied One Health domains.','text','pre_conference',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:04:46','2026-10-07 04:04:46'),(534,'pre_conf_obj_3','To discuss regional priorities related to antimicrobial resistance, infectious diseases, zoonotic diseases, veterinary public health, IKS and public health.','text','pre_conference',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:04:46','2026-10-07 04:04:46'),(535,'pre_conf_obj_4','To integrate diverse expert perspectives into the scientific sessions and thematic discussions of GOHC 2026.','text','pre_conference',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:04:46','2026-10-07 04:04:46'),(536,'pre_conf_obj_5','To strengthen institutional and professional collaboration towards advancing sustainable and integrated One Health approaches.','text','pre_conference',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:04:46','2026-10-07 04:04:46'),(537,'pre_conf_obj_count','5','text','pre_conference',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:04:46','2026-10-07 04:04:46'),(538,'contact_foreign_title','Foreign Students','text','contact',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:43:17','2026-10-07 04:43:17'),(539,'contact_foreign_note','Kindly contact Dean IP regarding Visa','text','contact',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:43:17','2026-10-07 04:43:17'),(540,'contact_foreign_email','deanip@mcc.edu.in','text','contact',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:43:17','2026-10-07 04:43:17'),(541,'contact_accom_title','Accommodation','text','contact',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:43:17','2026-10-07 04:43:17'),(542,'contact_accom_note','Will be updated soon','text','contact',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:43:17','2026-10-07 04:43:17'),(543,'contact_hero_title','CONTACT US','text','contact',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:43:17','2026-10-07 04:43:17'),(544,'contact_page_title','Contact Us','text','contact',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:43:17','2026-10-07 04:43:17'),(545,'contact_website','https://biomed.mccmrfip.in/','text','contact',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:43:17','2026-10-07 04:43:17'),(546,'topbar_ticker_mode','custom','text','topbar',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:51:23','2026-10-07 04:51:23'),(547,'topbar_ticker_1','All the Presentation will be published as a conference proceedings in ISBN indexed book','text','topbar',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:51:23','2026-10-07 04:51:23'),(548,'topbar_ticker_2','Quality presentation will be peer reviewed and considered for further publication in selected Scopus/ WoS indexed journals','text','topbar',NULL,'2026-10-07 04:51:23','2026-10-07 04:51:23'),(549,'stall_banner_title','STALL BOOKING AND MERCHANDISE','text','stall_booking',NULL,'2026-10-07 05:39:24','2026-10-07 05:39:24'),(550,'stall_banner_subtitle','Partnership Avenues, Tariff Details & Sponsorship Opportunities | Global One Health Confluence 2026','text','stall_booking',NULL,'2026-10-07 05:39:24','2026-10-07 05:39:24'),(551,'stall_brochures_json','[{\"title\":\"Partnership Avenues for Analytical Service Providers\",\"image\":\"images\\/stall_booking\\/stall_brochure_1.png\"},{\"title\":\"Tariff Details & Sponsorship Opportunities (Matrix)\",\"image\":\"images\\/stall_booking\\/stall_brochure_2.png\"},{\"title\":\"Partnership Avenues for Hospitals & Health Sectors\",\"image\":\"images\\/stall_booking\\/stall_brochure_3.png\"},{\"title\":\"Tariff Details & Sponsorship Opportunities (Contact & Notes)\",\"image\":\"images\\/stall_booking\\/stall_brochure_4.png\"}]','text','stall_booking',NULL,'2026-10-07 05:39:24','2026-10-07 06:42:39'),(552,'stall_sponsors_badge','Proudly Supported By','text','stall_booking',NULL,'2026-10-07 05:39:24','2026-10-07 05:39:24'),(553,'stall_sponsors_title','Our Sponsors & Industry Partners','text','stall_booking',NULL,'2026-10-07 05:39:24','2026-10-07 05:39:24'),(554,'stall_sponsors_json','[{\"name\":\"Anderson Diagnostics & Labs\",\"logo\":\"images\\/sponsors\\/anderson_logo.svg\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/andersondiagnostics.com\"},{\"name\":\"Sponsorship Partner\",\"logo\":\"images\\/sponsors\\/sponsor_logo_1.jpg\",\"link\":\"#\"}]','text','stall_booking',NULL,'2026-10-07 05:39:24','2026-10-07 05:39:24'),(555,'stall_cta_text','Interested in partnering or booking an exhibition stall?','text','stall_booking',NULL,'2026-10-07 05:39:24','2026-10-07 05:39:24'),(556,'stall_cta_btn_label','Contact Sponsorship Committee','text','stall_booking',NULL,'2026-10-07 05:39:24','2026-10-07 05:39:24'),(557,'stall_cta_btn_url','/contact','text','stall_booking',NULL,'2026-10-07 05:39:24','2026-10-07 05:39:24'),(558,'tracks_banner_title','SCIENTIFIC TRACKS & THRUST AREAS','text','tracks_page',NULL,'2026-10-07 05:53:11','2026-10-07 05:53:11'),(559,'tracks_banner_subtitle','Research and innovation at the confluence of human, animal, and environmental health. Discover the multidisciplinary tracks and focus areas shaping this conference.','text','tracks_page',NULL,'2026-10-07 05:53:11','2026-10-07 05:53:11'),(560,'tracks_section_badge','Conference Themes','text','tracks_page',NULL,'2026-10-07 05:53:11','2026-10-07 05:53:11'),(561,'tracks_section_title','Thrust Areas','text','tracks_page',NULL,'2026-10-07 05:53:11','2026-10-07 05:53:11'),(562,'tracks_section_desc','Explore the core conference tracks, thrust topics, and focus areas driving our collaborative approach to global One Health.','text','tracks_page',NULL,'2026-10-07 05:53:11','2026-10-07 05:53:11'),(563,'tracks_references_title','References','text','tracks_page',NULL,'2026-10-07 05:53:11','2026-10-07 05:53:11'),(564,'tracks_references_json','[\"Qasim, S., Khan, A. U., & Raza, A. (2024). Zoonotic diseases and antimicrobial resistance: a dual threat at the human\\u2013animal interface.\",\"Bett, B., F\\u00e8vre, E. M., Ha Thi Thanh Nguyen, Sinh Dang-Xuan, Obuta, A., Mateo-Sagasta, J., & Patel, E. (2024). Enhancing public health: Five key takeaways on zoonotic disease and antimicrobial resistance surveillance. One Health Knowledge Brief. Nairobi, Kenya: ILRI.\",\"Constructing a One Health governance architecture: a systematic review and analysis of governance mechanisms for One Health. (2024). PMC11631453.\",\"Analyzing One Health governance and implementation challenges. (2025). BMJ Open, 16(7), e115471.\",\"Zielinski, C., et al. (2023). Time to treat the climate and nature crisis as one indivisible global health emergency. BMC Global and Public Health, 1:29.\",\"One Health: Change our Paradigm, Change our Lives. (2023). Universidade de \\u00c9vora.\",\"Editorial: Advances in nanotechnology for the removal and detection of emerging contaminants from water. (2025). Frontiers in Chemistry.\",\"Call for papers: Next-generation green remediation technologies for emerging contaminants. (2025). Bentham Science.\",\"Traditional medicine and intellectual property rights among Indian Indigenous communities: a review. (2023). University of Lapland research repository.\",\"Indian Journal of Traditional Knowledge. National Institute of Science Communication and Policy Research (CSIR).\",\"ESG in pharma: How CDMOs drive sustainable supply chains. (2025). Neuland Labs.\",\"Sustainability in Pharma Industry [white paper]. (2025). Indian Pharmaceutical Alliance.\"]','text','tracks_page',NULL,'2026-10-07 05:53:11','2026-10-07 05:53:11'),(565,'topbar_speed','55','text','topbar',NULL,'2026-10-07 06:45:52','2026-10-07 06:45:52');
